<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mutthal Janta Party (MJP) - Official Website</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #ff4500;
            --secondary: #ffcc00;
            --dark: #121212;
            --light: #f4f4f4;
            --card-bg: #1e1e1e;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: var(--light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            color: #000;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .ticker-wrap {
            background: #000;
            color: var(--secondary);
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .ticker {
            display: inline-block;
            animation: marquee 20s linear infinite;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        @keyframes marquee {
            0% { transform: translate3d(100%, 0, 0); }
            100% { transform: translate3d(-100%, 0, 0); }
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        @media(min-width: 768px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card h2 {
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        ul {
            list-style-type: none;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        li::before {
            content: "✊";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        input[type="text"], input[type="email"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            background-color: #2b2b2b;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        button {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--primary);
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #cc3700;
        }

        .id-card-display {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50, #000);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 2px solid var(--secondary);
            text-align: center;
            display: none;
        }

        .id-card-display h3 {
            color: var(--secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .id-details {
            text-align: left;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            font-family: monospace;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Mutthal Janta Party (MJP)</h1>
        <p>Aane do humko saanson mein, Rasiya batwa denge rasan me! 🏛️✊</p>
    </header>

    <div class="ticker-wrap">
        <div class="ticker">
            🚨 BREAKING NEWS: MJP Swarm expanding rapidly across social media! • Free high-speed internet data for all members is our top priority! • Join the movement today! 🚨
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Manifesto & Details -->
            <main>
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Our Vision & Manifesto</h2>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem; font-style: italic; color: #aaa;">"Finally, humne apni nayi party khadi kar di hai! Humara maqsad ekdum saaf hai."</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Digital Empowerment:</strong> 100GB complimentary night data for uninterrupted streams.</li>
                        <li><strong>Privacy Protocols:</strong> Automatic history-clearing filters built directly into national ISPs.</li>
                        <li><strong>Anti-Stress Frameworks:</strong> Mandatory wellness hours across schools, colleges, and corporate offices.</li>
                        <li><strong>Anti-Defection Stance:</strong> 20-year bans on politicians switching loyalties mid-term.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><strong>Q: Is joining MJP free?</strong><br>Yes, membership is 100% free forever. No OTP, no hidden premium tiers.</p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 1rem;"><strong>Q: What do I get upon registering?</strong><br>You get immediate bragging rights and a unique verifiable digital membership ID card instantly.</p>
                </div>
            </main>

            <!-- Right Column: Registration -->
            <aside>
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Join the Swarm</h2>
                    <form id="joinForm">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="name">Full Name</label>
                            <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="e.g., Backbencher No. 1">
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="email">Email Address</label>
                            <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="e.g., single@mjp.org">
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit">Generate Member Card</button>
                    </form>

                    <!-- Generated ID Card Output -->
                    <div id="idCard" class="id-card-display">
                        <h3>MJP Official Member</h3>
                        <div style="font-size: 3rem;">✊</div>
                        <div class="id-details">
                            <p><strong>NAME:</strong> <span id="cardName"></span></p>
                            <p><strong>MEMBER ID:</strong> <span id="cardId"></span></p>
                            <p><strong>STATUS:</strong> Certified Revolutionist</p>
                            <p style="color: var(--secondary); margin-top: 0.5rem; text-align: center;">SURVIVE • ADAPT • CONQUER</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </aside>

        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Mutthal Janta Party. Content generated purely for satire, entertainment, and youth advocacy movements.</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('joinForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            
            const name = document.getElementById('name').value;
            const randomId = 'MJP-' + Math.floor(100000 + Math.random() * 900000);
            
            document.getElementById('cardName').innerText = name;
            document.getElementById('cardId').innerText = randomId;
            
            document.getElementById('idCard').style.display = 'block';
            document.getElementById('joinForm').reset();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
